==Arachne
=died1
Arachne... yeah, you two are kinda alike. She, just like you, had no problem showing disrespect to the gods.#speaker:Athena
I’ve heard stories. If it were up to her, I bet she’d have woven a tapestry with Zeus and a lightning bolt right up his backside.#speaker:Apistos
Apistos,you’re walking on thin ice. That’s straight-up disrespect to the gods!#speaker: Athena
Thanks, I’ll take that as a compliment. To be honest, I never really respected you all much in the first place—and it turns out, I’m not the first, and definitely won’t be the last. You’ve given me plenty of reasons...#speaker:Apistos
I’m so done with your chatter! Just get going already!#speaker:Athena
